# Bankrupt in Blood: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice two creatures" (CR 118.8, 601.2b-h). The cost
# can only be paid with creatures its caster controls, so an attempt with one creature of its own is reversed - a noncreature
# Mox and an opponent's creature do not count - and succeeds once a second creature of its own arrives
# (the positive control, on turn 3). The opponent's Ornithopter is never offered for the sacrifice and stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Bankrupt in Blood
Swamp x3
Ornithopter
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x13

